<title>UK: Export Dev Corp sets $170 mln four-year bond.</title>
<headline>Export Dev Corp sets $170 mln four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto Dominion Bank and Taiheiyo Europe Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EXPORT DEVELOPMENT CORP </p>
<p> AMT    $170 MLN	COUPON     5.65	MATURITY    24.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE  S-27.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.10	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =/AA+     DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    **	  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES	**ONTARIO AND CANADA</p>
<p>		DIRECT AND UNCONDITIONAL OBLIGATIONS OF EDC AND HER</p>
<p>		MAJESTY IN RIGHT OF CANADA</p>
<p>		ISSUED UNDER THE PROGRAMME FOR THE ISSUANCE OF DEBT</p>
<p>		INSTRUMENTS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
